{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act31side_level_act31side_st03",
  "groupId": "act31side",
  "stageId": "act31side_st03",
  "title": "徹風雨",
  "storyCode": "HS-ST-3",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act31side/level_act31side_st03.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d246f1919e95193748606152afe3a7811f28c97c9549765c231d93aad0c13991",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g06_mountainroad_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳咳……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳……咳……呼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "癆病的老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1239_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就非要約我來爬這天岳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "癆病的老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1239_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個陽處的位置我先佔了，你坐那邊去。我身子沒你好，你別跟我搶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "出來散散步，曬曬太陽，嚐嚐這天岳的泉水，對你的身體有好處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1239_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真好笑，我們幾十年沒在那堵宮牆外打過照面，這次是你主動約的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1239_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……到底還是你先坐不住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很難坐得住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玉門，大荒城。這一連串的事，總要一個說法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1239_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對，都是我幹的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1239_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玉門山海眾是我教唆的，睚也是我引入關的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1239_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些夠把我拉下台嗎？要是嫌不夠，望是我放出京城的，那個孩子是我送去維多利亞的，邪魔的口子也是我撕開的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1239_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要有需要，讓三公的位置再空一個出來，這些事都可以是我做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1239_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "山海眾，烏合之眾，能成什麼氣候？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1239_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "睚，不過是條癆病獸，派上幾十上百個天師，總能打發了，不過用來當作喚醒歲的口糧倒是正好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1239_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老魔小丑，不足掛齒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1239_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳……咳……呼……說到底，我也不過是個老癆病鬼，我這條命，也就只剩這點用得到的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就不怕事情超出掌控，你從來不會怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1239_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我怕的東西可太多了……我怕“人心叵測”，我怕“大勢所趨”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1239_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "見風使舵，一人拉一邊，是求個平衡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1239_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可事到如今，那個罪人已經掀了棋盤，我們還有半分求和的可能嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1239_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玉門城已經修復完畢，在趕來京城的路上了。太傅大人，早做打算吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "47_g6_civilengineermasteroffice"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "復職信……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這封信原本不該由我來送。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大荒城的事件，那兩個罪人的所作所為，朝廷已經得知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在司歲台、天師府、六部……朝野上下，全都忙成一團。我出公事經過大荒城，就代勞了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是母親她，拜託你來的吧……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……多謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這次代理人引發的動亂，朝中已經有結論了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玉門城已修復完畢，已重新啟動駛向京城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還是到了這一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你倒是鎮定，我還以為你會立刻吵著要回到前線呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這段時間，我想明白一個道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恐懼才會急躁……越是不敢面對未知的敵人，就越想埋頭衝過去，不管結果如何，只當給自己一個交代。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……可我現在不會害怕了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些代理人，縱使有改天換地的能力，可說到底，他們也有人情人性，在這方面，祂們與我們並無不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“對手”並非不可捉摸，那就沒什麼好怕的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_landscape"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "左公子，在下的確無意與你為敵。剛才說過的話，只希望左公子記得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來日方長，我們還會有再見面的時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "47_g6_civilengineermasteroffice"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還不錯，左將軍讓你來這裡修心，也不算白來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已經準備妥當，隨時可以動身。現在該去哪？玉門，還是百灶？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不急，先回歸一下你的本職工作吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有一個地方，與代理人接觸頗多。雖說朝廷對那裡並非一無所知，依照慣例，還是由司歲台去調查一下為好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……羅德島？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "47_g3_fieldpath"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你真的要走了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這一批種子，有些種了出來，源石耐受性的表現比預想的要好，是時候帶去外面的田地裡做下一步培育了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是不是很辛苦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和在大荒城做的事一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔……那你什麼時候回來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先是把種子送去全國各個糧食種植基地，培育第一批試種植株，再根據莊稼對不同土地的適應狀況，找合適的培育方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要得出確切的結果，可能要十代以上的培育。應該是，很長一段時間……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……一代莊稼就是一年，十年……那是多長一段時間呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夠綿綿長得和他的爸爸媽媽一樣大……好像也不是很長嘛，換了新飼料後，牧獸都長得很快，每天都會變大一圈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是十年，也是要等忘花果樹結十回酸果子……這麼一想，又好像永遠都等不到似的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，我再送送你吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "笛聲纏綿著，伴著夕陽跟在二人身後。泥土路上，兩排腳印踏出去很遠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_town"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "江南。\n大哥曾經說過，卸任之後，想去江南看看。\n幾百年沒有嚐過江南夏天的菱角，見慣了黃沙戈壁，就在小橋流水的小鎮裡歇歇吧。只是要小心點，別再把這幅畫打破了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g3_yumenobservationtower_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "令始終忘不了那片大漠。\n她不是喜歡戰爭，只是喜歡沙場上人們的豪情萬丈罷了……誰會不喜歡？\n畫裡沒有吹角連營的戰火，只有大漠孤煙，長河落日。你就安心在這裡喝你的酒，當你的詩人吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g03_yandowntown_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "年會喜歡熱鬧的地方，但比起龍門，還是尚蜀的口味更適合她。\n你就老老實實在這裡待著，別來煩我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "二哥……應該只給他畫一副棋盤的。\n心思都在算計上，審美也太差了點……這個園子送你，我也不想再見你了。\n算到最後，竟也沒有給自己留半分退路，你到底……呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g08_pavilion"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "頡……\n要不是你太愛嘮叨，又總擺一副姐姐的架子，我真的想過要找你學書法的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "47_g10_fairyfarmland_ex"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……行了，就這樣吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "費了這些心思，誰知道大夢醒時，這些畫還能不能留住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "留得下如何，留不下又如何。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來過了，見過了，千載春秋黃粱一夢，早就盡興。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……有你們在，我也不算孤單。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "畫家拋下筆，身形遁去。\n長空澄澈如白卷，有一行羽獸掠過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "長短還合身嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "布料只有這一匹，要是不小心裁壞了，我可沒地再找新的去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再合適不過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事到如今，再問這句話或許遲了一點……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……勝算有幾成？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "半目勝負，生死之間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽起來，很容易虧得血本無歸啊……也沒有退路就是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "何時動手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萬事俱備，只欠……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_mini01_villagevacancy"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "農人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黍姑娘，我們這裡的田都已經荒了幾年了，真的還能種莊稼？方法用對了，就能種出糧食？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每片土地適合的作物不一樣，改良土壤，還要用合適的方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這撥種子已經種下去了，等秋天的時候，你們就能看到結果了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "農人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黍姑娘，您從哪來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "農人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您看起來這麼年輕，對這田裡的事懂得還真多……您說您是天師府的天師？天師是什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是專門研究知識，再教給更多人的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "農人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真了不起啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "農人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黍姑娘，您先忙著，我去幫您倒杯水去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的童聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "七月亨葵，九月授衣。春日載陽，有鳴倉庚……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的童聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "九月築場圃，十月納禾農，黍稷重穋，禾麻菽麥……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“七月亨葵，九月授衣。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大荒城冬天來得早，今年也得早點準備冬衣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐，要不要幫你做一套新衣裳？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我哪裡用得上……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我新琢磨了一種紡織辦法，織出來的緞面又輕又耐用，顏色也好看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我都想好了新衣裳的樣子，你穿上肯定好看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，隨你吧……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣算是“人”的生活嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好像……也算快樂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你已經真實地活過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_outcounty"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生，您教我那些行商的道理，我都已經了然於心。只是最後，我還是有一件事不解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "世間萬物，飄渺如幻，我到底該如何估價？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看，我身上這個玉墜值幾文錢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道這枚玉墜，不過是個尋常物件，在地攤上，最多賣二兩銀子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是這玉墜是我娘留給我的遺物，我從記事起就一直帶著。對我來說，它價值無量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "估價，到頭來，估的還是人心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我記著了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快入夏了……江南荔枝正是好時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "北部天乾，種出來的荔枝就是不甜，比不上故鄉的味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本想這次回到老家，能再開一條商路，把南方的荔枝賣到北方去，結果隔著一道江，再也回不去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可恨這一場雨，實在不是時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等過兩天入夏了，也等您身子暖起來，我們就僱條船過江。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了……我心裡清楚，我的路，就到這了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人吶，為什麼總是要逆天而行呢……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你今年，多大了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們這種人的年齡，不太好算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一定要算的話，過了小暑，剛好五十。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看得出來，你和常人不太一樣……羨慕你有這麼長的壽命，但是轉念一想，這麼長的一生啊，得多辛苦啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管你是什麼樣，我今年八十三了，你跟著我這麼久，認你當養子，你也不算吃虧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "與您相逢一場，見過這片大地上無限風光，實屬幸事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "相逢有緣，我也沒什麼好贈與你的。除了那點不值錢的家業，就剩這句話了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天下熙熙，皆為利來；天下攘攘，皆為利往。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……這句話，我從學做生意的第一天起，就一直念到現在。我也靠著這句話，贏了不少敵人對手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可這天下，若是一個“利”字就說盡了，那未免也太無聊了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的時間不多了，走不了多少路。若你真的有那麼漫長的壽命，那就替我去看看吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走遍這片大地，去看看這世上是否有一個能讓普天下人共贏的“大利”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是真的能找到的話……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會記得……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會去看看的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
